{"words": [{"text": "وَمِنَ", "translation": "And of"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "the people"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "(are some) who"}, {"text": "يَقُولُ", "translation": "say"}, {"text": "ءَامَنَّا", "translation": "We believed"}, {"text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translation": "in Allah"}, {"text": "وَبِٱلْيَوْمِ", "translation": "and in the Day"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ", "translation": "[the] Last"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "but not"}, {"text": "هُم", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "بِمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "(are) believers (at all)"}], "sahih": "And of the people are some who say, \"We believe in Allāh and the Last Day,\" but they are not believers."}